  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  poemTexts:
  - "I\u2019ll be with you\r\nNext year, as we drink our morning cup\r\nSlightly
    scuffed and slightly bitter, you sip \r\nAnd sigh how long we haven\u2019t been
    there."
  - 'Eyes down and left, a lizard out of shot.

    I sip and run my fingers over
    yours.

    And tell you Fear not.'
  textIndex: 0
